          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether applying the good\u2011faith rule would deny retroactive effect to the altered judgment and whether the good\u2011faith exception is a separate question from retroactivity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
