            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether the petitioner\u2019s argument applies when the precedent relied upon is from a circuit or state court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1812768977ea14d58bdea56b6e4475e435d508ad1553b04fd718b06bc8f902d1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1812768977ea-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg inquired whether the Eleventh Circuit\u2019s line reflects retroactivity precedent."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1812768977ea14d58bdea56b6e4475e435d508ad1553b04fd718b06bc8f902d1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1812768977ea-0000-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan raised concerns about incentives and suggested a limited rule applying the exclusionary rule only in the present case and not on direct appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1812768977ea14d58bdea56b6e4475e435d508ad1553b04fd718b06bc8f902d1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1812768977ea-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether it is worthwhile to litigate the difference between zero and remote in determining the rule to apply."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1812768977ea14d58bdea56b6e4475e435d508ad1553b04fd718b06bc8f902d1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1812768977ea-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned a regime where the exclusionary rule would apply depending on whether the law was clear in a circuit, raising concerns about qualified immunity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1812768977ea14d58bdea56b6e4475e435d508ad1553b04fd718b06bc8f902d1",
            "evidence_ids": [
